{"id":"00047","root":"uni00047_1","name":{"ja":"篠原　まり","en":"Shinohara Mari"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"篠原　まり","en":"Shinohara Mari"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":43,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通う学生対魔忍。対魔忍の中でもバカ力の持ち主で、忍法として土遁を使い、自在に土を操ることができる。身体能力の高さもあり学生でありながら任務にもよく出撃しているが、若干ドジなところがあるのが玉にきずである。紫のようにクールでカッコいい感じになろうと考えるも、周りからは絶対無理と言われている。学校ではクラス委員長として毎日頑張っている。","en":"Shinohara Mari is a student Taimanin attending Gosha Academy. Among Taimanin, she possesses extraordinary brute strength and uses earth-style ninjutsu to manipulate soil at will. Her high physical abilities allow her to join missions frequently despite being a student, though she has a slightly clumsy side that sometimes gets her into trouble. She strives to be as cool and stylish as the color purple, but everyone tells her it's impossible. At school she works hard every day as class president."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00047_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[770,1540],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[84,168],"def":[123,246],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","113"]},{"id":"uni00047_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1140,2280],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[118,236],"def":[196,392],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","113","114"]},{"id":"uni00047_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1510,3019],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[152,305],"def":[269,537],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","113","114"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural