e advice?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"な、何してるんですか！？　わ、私だって怒りますよ～！","en":"W-what are you doing?! I… I get angry too, you know!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"えへへ、まだ見習いですけどこれでも私結構強いんです！　どんと任せて下さい！","en":"Hehe, I'm still a trainee but I'm pretty strong even now! Leave it to me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ひゃあっ！？　うう……また転んじゃった、め、眼鏡どこ～？","en":"Whoa! Ugh… I fell again, wh-where are my glasses?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"私も読書が好きなんですけど、ひなたぼっこしながらだといつのまにか寝ちゃうんですよねぇ～","en":"I love reading too, but when I bask in the sun I end up falling asleep without noticing~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"対魔忍篠原まりです！　土遁の術が得意で、力にはちょっと自信があります！","en":"Taimanin Shinohara Mari here! I'm good at earth-style ninjutsu and I'm pretty confident in my strength!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"よく友達とかにはドジだって言われるんですけど、頑張ってクールでカッコイイ感じを目指します！","en":"My friends always call me clumsy, but I'll keep trying to be cool and stylish!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00047_1/uni00047_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni0